title: task_munir_2_inactive
---
Munir: Assalamaleykum Prince!  
Prince: Walaykum assalam, Munir.  
Munir: We’re expecting a big turnout for Jumu’ah. I could use a bit of help with prep.  
Prince: What do you need?  
Munir: Three quick things. 
Munir: First, collect the mats inside the mosque.  
Munir: Then, near the entrance — there's some trash bags. Clean them up.  
Munir: Finally, at the front gate — there is some rubbish. Make sure it’s all cleared out.  
Prince: Got it. I’ll handle it.  
<<activateQuest "Munir/Tasks/MunirTask2">>
<<trackQuest "Munir/Tasks/MunirTask2">>
===


title: task_munir_2_active
---
Munir: Have you finished the errands yet, Prince?  
Prince: Not yet. Still making the rounds.  
Munir: Alright. Just make sure it’s all done before people start arriving for Jumu’ah.  
===

title: task_munir_2_completed
---
Munir: I checked the mats, the entrance, and the gate — all clean.  
Prince: Told you I’d handle it.  
Munir: BarakAllahu feek, Prince. You did well.  
Prince: Glad I could help out.  
===


title: task_munir_2_abandoned
---
Munir: The mats are still there, the entrance is a mess, and the gate’s not been cleared.  
Prince: I didn’t get to it.  
Munir: Hmm. A small task left undone can lead to a bigger mess later.  
Prince: You’re right. I’ll be better next time.  
===

title: task_munir_2_failed
---
Munir: The people are here, and none of the spots were ready.  
Prince: I let it slip.  
Munir: People rely on us to make this place welcoming. You have to be on time.  
Prince: Lesson learned. I’ll be sharper next time.  
===

